{"step_index":152,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-31T15:55:33Z","thinking":"**Constructing the HTML**\n\nI'm now implementing the `dekai_jetbrains_ai_portal.html` file. I've set the image source for the logo to `\"logo-white.png\"`, ensuring it's relative to the page for correct loading. I'm also increasing desktop font sizes significantly; specifically, I'm using `text-base sm:text-lg lg` for the body copy, to ensure the text is legible on larger screens.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"優化 Portal 網站：1. 修正 LOGO 白圖片路徑為相對方 `logo-white.png`，確保在本地與 Firebase 上均能正確顯示；2. 大幅升級電腦版 (Desktop / Laptop) 字體大小與行距，確保大螢幕簡報清晰防瞇眼；3. 右側 01-06 浮動選單改為 md 螢幕以上即可顯示的大尺寸簡報專用側欄。","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-TW\" class=\"scroll-smooth\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>JetBrains AI Assistant 企業級開發助手 - 迪凱科技 AHASoft</title>\n  <script src=\"https://www.gstatic.com/antigravity/web/dev/tailwindcss.min.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap');\n    body {\n      font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n    }\n    .accordion-content {\n      transition: max-height 0.4s ease, opacity 0.4s ease;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n    .accordion-closed {\n      max-height: 0 !important;\n      opacity: 0;\n      padding-top: 0 !important;\n      padding-bottom: 0 !important;\n      margin-top: 0 !important;\n      pointer-events: none;\n    }\n    .accordion-open {\n      max-height: 4000px !important;\n      opacity: 1;\n    }\n    .text-glow {\n      text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(129, 140, 248, 0.7);\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 antialiased selection:bg-indigo-500 selection:text-white\">\n\n  <!-- Navigation Bar (頂部凍結列：左側放置「JetBrains LOGO 白」) -->\n  <nav class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 bg-slate-950/95 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-slate-800/80\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-20 flex items-center justify-between\">\n      \n      <!-- LOGO 白 + 品牌文字標題區 -->\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n        <!-- JetBrains LOGO 白 圖片 (使用相對路徑 logo-white.png，本地與 Firebase 皆能正確載入) -->\n        <img src=\"logo-white.png\" alt=\"JetBrains White Logo\" class=\"h-10 sm:h-12 w-auto object-contain bg-slate-950 rounded-lg p-1 border border-slate-800 shadow-md\">\n\n        <div class=\"border-l-2 border-slate-800 pl-4\">\n          <span class=\"font-black text-lg sm:text-xl lg:text-2xl text-white tracking-tight block\">JetBrains AI Assistant</span>\n          <span class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-indigo-400\">台灣官方代理 迪凱科技 AHASoft</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n        <a href=\"https://trust-center.jetbrains.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"hidden sm:flex items-center gap-2 text-sm lg:text-base text-slate-200 hover:text-white border border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-500 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl transition-all font-semibold bg-slate-900/60\">\n          <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 text-emerald-400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z\"></path></svg>\n          Trust Center 驗證\n        </a>\n        <button onclick=\"openTrialModal()\" class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-bold text-sm sm:text-base transition-all shadow-lg shadow-indigo-600/30\">\n          申請 30 天企業試用\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n\n  <!-- 右側浮動快捷導覽 Dock (Floating Quick Nav Bar: 電腦版 md/lg/xl 畫面右側大圖按鈕) -->\n  <aside class=\"fixed right-4 top-28 z-40 hidden md:flex flex-col gap-2.5 bg-slate-900/95 p-4 rounded-2xl border-2 border-indigo-500/40 backdrop-blur-xl shadow-2xl w-60 lg:w-64 transition-all\">\n    <div class=\"text-xs lg:text-sm font-extrabold text-indigo-400 uppercase tracking-widest pb-2 border-b border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between\">\n      <span>右側快捷導航</span>\n      <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 font-mono\">01 ~ 06</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm lg:text-base\">\n      <button onclick=\"navigateToSection('sec-1')\" class=\"nav-btn group p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/80 hover:bg-indigo-600/30 border border-slate-800 hover:border-indigo-500/60 text-left transition-all flex items-center gap-2.5\">\n        <span class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-md bg-indigo-500/30 text-indigo-300 font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\">01</span>\n        <span class=\"text-white font-bold truncate group-hover:text-indigo-300\">01. 產品簡介</span>\n      </button>\n\n      <button onclick=\"navigateToSection('sec-2')\" class=\"nav-btn group p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/80 hover:bg-indigo-600/30 border border-slate-800 hover:border-indigo-500/60 text-left transition-all flex items-center gap-2.5\">\n        <span class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-md bg-purple-500/30 text-purple-300 font-bold text-xs flex items-cen